+    /**
+     * A start of an app for Autostart (PERM-15), recorded in the history under its result, how
+     * the app would start and who asked, in place of the attribution tag:
+     * {@code lujarch:started:<how>:<package>} or {@code lujarch:stopped:<how>:<package>}, the
+     * package empty for the system. The system asks with {@link #lujarchStartTag} as the tag of
+     * its note. PermissionController's LujarchStarts reads the same tags.
